  "memories": [
    {
      "id": "m-20250119-0",
      "key": "mem_20250119_0",
      "day": "20250119",
      "text": "You kept the bed. Gilbert said to answer the last one first.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250119/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250119",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250119#meeting_110000_720",
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250119#photo_111800_120",
          "sol://facets/stratford/activities/20250119#frame_112200_240"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250120-1",
      "key": "mem_20250120_1",
      "day": "20250120",
      "text": "You were well. You tried the spring note and stopped.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250120/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250120",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250120#meeting_082000_720",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250120#note_111000_600",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250120#frame_112200_180"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250121-2",
      "key": "mem_20250121_2",
      "day": "20250121",
      "text": "The last line is in. Garnish has the book. Rosaline keeps Berowne. Katharine keeps Dumaine. You kept the refusal.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250121/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250121",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250121#meeting_091500_840",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250121#note_121000_600",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250121#frame_122200_180"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250122-3",
      "key": "mem_20250122_3",
      "day": "20250122",
      "text": "Venus moves. Lucrece is respected. The wedding at Greenwich stayed news.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250122/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250122",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250122#meeting_103500_840",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250122#photo_110200_120",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250122#note_204000_480"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250123-4",
      "key": "mem_20250123_4",
      "day": "20250123",
      "text": "A shortened grievance came back longer. Thirty-three shillings was Margery's stair.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250123/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250123",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250123#meeting_101000_840",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250123#photo_102800_120",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250123#memo_115200_60"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250124-5",
      "key": "mem_20250124_5",
      "day": "20250124",
      "text": "He struck two oaths and signed. Seven shillings, company coin, counted at the priory.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250124/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250124",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250124#meeting_090500_720",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250124#frame_102000_240",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250124#meeting_110000_840"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250125-6",
      "key": "mem_20250125_6",
      "day": "20250125",
      "text": "You played Two Gentlemen and set next week.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250125/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250125",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/stratford/activities/20250125#note_103000_480",
          "sol://facets/stratford/activities/20250125#frame_104200_180",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250125#meeting_165000_840"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "said": [
    {
      "id": "s-20250119-0",
      "key": "said_20250119_0",
      "day": "20250119",
      "quote": "All three children want shoes, and they have agreed to outgrow them in the same month. Father has a cough, and he is cheerful about it.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/household/activities/20250119#meeting_110000_720"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250119-1",
      "key": "said_20250119_1",
      "day": "20250119",
      "quote": "The songs are not written. The last line is not written. That is the truth of the bolster, and I will not improve it.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250119#memo_211000_240"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250120-2",
      "key": "said_20250120_2",
      "day": "20250120",
      "quote": "I will not buy ink to feel busy. The owl is not written because I have not heard it, not because the horn is low.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/household/activities/20250120#meeting_082000_720"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250121-3",
      "key": "said_20250121_3",
      "day": "20250121",
      "quote": "The letter is on her table. I have shut one door today. I am not shutting that one with a sentence I do not mean.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250121#memo_211000_240"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250122-4",
      "key": "said_20250122_4",
      "day": "20250122",
      "quote": "Respected is a quiet word. Moves is not. I hear which of them you trust.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250122#meeting_103500_840"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250123-5",
      "key": "said_20250123_5",
      "day": "20250123",
      "quote": "They sell explanations by the sheet. So do I. Mine have jokes in.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250123#memo_115200_60"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250124-6",
      "key": "said_20250124_6",
      "day": "20250124",
      "quote": "I was never cut so little, and felt it so much.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/company/activities/20250124#meeting_121200_120"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250125-7",
      "key": "said_20250125_7",
      "day": "20250125",
      "quote": "I have Two Gents in my legs and a week in my head, and I am not adding a sum to either.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/company/activities/20250125#meeting_165000_840"
      }
    }
  ]
}
